From 1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ind OS Kernel Team <kernel@indos.dev>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] arm64: dts: qcom: sm7150: add Motorola Moto G60 (hanoip) device tree

Adds device tree for Motorola Moto G60 (hanoip) powered by Qualcomm SM7150-AC.
Enables:
- CPU Kryo 470 topology and OPP tables
- MDSS DSI0 display engine with Novatek NT36672C 120Hz panel
- I2C4 FocalTech FT8756 touchscreen bindings
- Reserved memory partitions for OP-TEE TrustZone (1.5 GB) and Framebuffer (32 MB)

Signed-off-by: Ind OS Kernel Team <kernel@indos.dev>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile                  |  1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-motorola-hanoip.dts | 85 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 86 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-motorola-hanoip.dts

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
index a1b2c3d..e4f5a6b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
@@ -100,3 +100,4 @@
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM) += sm7150-idp.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM) += sm7150-motorola-hanoip.dtb
-- 
2.39.2
